ayloads are a property of the *build*: a `-O2` C build disagrees with the prescribed default `-O0` build on 11 NaN-only rows, so matching both is impossible.","ttft_ms":19665,"ttft_stream_ms":19472,"time_to_request_ms":36,"type":"result","duration_ms":2615595,"uuid":"eb867c8f-4cf1-4d0b-9be3-498130bdce41"}
